WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.092
Dad and the kids were building a tree house.

2
00:00:08.093 --> 00:00:12.538
They had wood, nails, and tools.

3
00:00:12.539 --> 00:00:18.240
Harry picked up the tape measure.

4
00:00:18.241 --> 00:00:21.926
"Can I measure?" asked Oliver.

5
00:00:21.927 --> 00:00:26.307
"Not now," said Harry.

6
00:00:26.308 --> 00:00:29.545
"It's my job."

7
00:00:29.546 --> 00:00:34.265
Oliver sighed.

8
00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:37.142
Emmy marked the wood with a pencil.

9
00:00:37.143 --> 00:00:40.331
"Can I do that?" asked Oliver.

10
00:00:40.332 --> 00:00:43.719
"No," said Emmy.

11
00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:48.008
"I'm doing it."

12
00:00:48.009 --> 00:00:52.009
Oliver sighed again.

13
00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:57.419
Dad plugged in the saw.

14
00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:02.103
"Can I use the saw?" asked Oliver.

15
00:01:02.104 --> 00:01:06.316
"No," said Dad.

16
00:01:06.317 --> 00:01:12.571
"The saw is very dangerous."

17
00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:16.947
Oliver kicked the dirt.

18
00:01:16.948 --> 00:01:20.508
Dad cut the wood.

19
00:01:20.509 --> 00:01:24.168
The saw was really loud.

20
00:01:24.169 --> 00:01:31.795
Harry and Emmy covered their ears.

21
00:01:31.796 --> 00:01:35.096
Oliver picked up a small piece of wood.

22
00:01:35.097 --> 00:01:39.793
Then he walked away.

23
00:01:39.794 --> 00:01:44.355
Dad, Harry and Emmy grabbed the hammers.

24
00:01:44.356 --> 00:01:48.622
They nailed the wood together.

25
00:01:48.623 --> 00:01:59.651
They built a ladder, a floor, and walls.

26
00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:03.854
Finally, the treehouse was finished.

27
00:02:03.855 --> 00:02:07.020
"Wow!" said Harry.

28
00:02:07.021 --> 00:02:14.690
"Our tree house looks great."

29
00:02:14.691 --> 00:02:18.662
"Where is Oliver?" asked Dad.

30
00:02:18.663 --> 00:02:21.831
"I don't know," said Emmy.

31
00:02:21.832 --> 00:02:41.900
They looked all over for Oliver.

32
00:02:41.901 --> 00:02:46.490
Harry heard a banging sound.

33
00:02:46.491 --> 00:02:52.302
"Someone is hammering," he said.

34
00:02:52.303 --> 00:02:57.445
They ran back to the tree house.

35
00:02:57.446 --> 00:02:59.289
"Whew!" said Emmy.

36
00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:03.676
"There's Oliver."

37
00:03:03.677 --> 00:03:06.909
"Thank you, Oliver!" said Dad.

38
00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:18.747
"Your sign is perfect!"

